{"shortDescription":"WORCESTER, Mass., Sept. 23, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- The Hanover Insurance Group, Inc. (NYSE:THG) expects to issue its third quarter financial results after the market closes on Wednesday, October 28, 2026. The company expects to webcast a discussion of its results on Thursday, October 29, at 10:00 a.m…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["WORCESTER, Mass., Sept. 23, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://edge.prnewswire.com/c/link/?t=0\u0026l=en\u0026o=4781684-1\u0026h=1594022380\u0026u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.hanover.com%2F\u0026a=The+Hanover+Insurance+Group%2C+Inc.","linkText":"The Hanover Insurance Group, Inc."}}," (",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:THG","text":"NYSE:THG"}},") expects to issue its third quarter financial results after the market closes on Wednesday, October 28, 2026. The company expects to webcast a discussion of its results on Thursday, October 29, at 10:00 a.m. ET, through its website at ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://edge.prnewswire.com/c/link/?t=0\u0026l=en\u0026o=4781684-1\u0026h=1817411713\u0026u=http%3A%2F%2Fhanover.com%2F\u0026a=hanover.com","linkText":"hanover.com"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"i","children":["About The Hanover"]}]},"The Hanover Insurance Group, Inc. is the holding company for several property and casualty insurance companies, which together constitute one of the largest insurance businesses in the United States. The company provides exceptional insurance solutions through a select group of independent agents and brokers. Together with its agent partners, The Hanover offers standard and specialized insurance protection for small and mid-sized businesses, as well as for homes, automobiles, and other personal items. For more information, please visit ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://edge.prnewswire.com/c/link/?t=0\u0026l=en\u0026o=4781684-1\u0026h=1817411713\u0026u=http%3A%2F%2Fhanover.com%2F\u